<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;it is safe to assume 'predigit' is initialized as zero by the compiler&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One should be careful with this assumption, I've seen several C compilers for microcontrollers that don't do this by default, in order to save on instruction memory (which can matter on tiny uC's).&lt;/p&gt;
